OL,3,CTemperatures expected to reach 36C as
OL,4,Cheatwave conditions return to UK
OL,6,FA hosepipe ban will cover most of the
OL,7,FSouth West following prolonged dry
OL,8,Fweather and rising pressure on
OL,9,Fsupplies, South West Water has
OL,10,Fannounced.
OL,12,FThe water firm says that, due to
OL,13,Fsignificantly below-average rainfall
OL,14,Fand high demand for supplies,
OL,15,Fcustomers in Devon, Cornwall, parts of
OL,16,FDorset and Somerset, and the Isles of
OL,17,FScilly should not use hosepipes for
OL,18,Fcertain activities from midnight on 8
OL,19,FAugust.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
