PN,31308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786148289
OL,3,CTemperatures expected to reach 36C as
OL,4,Cheatwave conditions return to UK
OL,6,FMeanwhile, the National Trust is
OL,7,Fasking people to sign a petition
OL,8,Fcalling on the Government to make
OL,9,Ftackling climate change a national
OL,10,Fmission.
OL,12,FIt comes after several wildfires have
OL,13,Fbroken out in the UK over recent
OL,14,Fweeks, with large blazes at Dunwich
OL,15,FHeath in Suffolk, Headon Warren on the
OL,16,FIsle of Wight, Llanwonno in the
OL,17,FRhondda Valleys, South Wales, and the
OL,18,FCairngorms National Park in Scotland.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
