PN,31311
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786148289
OL,3,CTemperatures expected to reach 36C as
OL,4,Cheatwave conditions return to UK
OL,6,FNineteen counties across England
OL,7,Frecorded effectively no rainfall ` 1mm
OL,8,For less ` across the whole of the
OL,9,Fmonth, Met Office figures show.
OL,11,FEngland as a whole had just a 10th of
OL,12,Fthe average rainfall for the month
OL,13,Fwhile Wales saw just 9% of the
OL,14,Faverage, with both countries seeing
OL,15,Fless than half of the rainfall in the
OL,16,Fprevious record dry July in 1911.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
