OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31312
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786148289
OL,3,CTemperatures expected to reach 36C as
OL,4,Cheatwave conditions return to UK
OL,6,FThe UK, England and Wales have all
OL,7,Frecorded their sunniest July on record
OL,8,F` and for England and Wales it was the
OL,9,Fsunniest calendar month ever observed,
OL,10,Fthe Met Office said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/12
